model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "A manager's own confirmed availability save keeps the hosted tool catalog on screen while the read it starts reconciles the setting, so an open writes menu survives the save; that read's answer then replaces the catalog. Only a list value the page acknowledged from its own save, with no other read pending, keeps the catalog: a return to the page, a linked-account change, a retry or a failed read still shows loading or the failure and never the previous tools. Browser evidence holds the group save and its catalog read with the writes menu open on every managed target, and a node test drives the real contract atoms through each case."
    }
  }
}
